WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.580
Here is a lump of animal fat.

2
00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:05.160
Fats like this are mostly solid.

3
00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:07.120
Vegetable oils are liquid.

4
00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:11.460
The fat is boiled under reflux
with sodium hydroxide solution.

5
00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:15.780
When the boiling is over, the
flask holds something new: soap.

6
00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:17.040
Fat goes in.

7
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:18.580
Soap comes out.

8
00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:21.660
So what has the hot
alkali done to the fat?

9
00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:26.420
In this mission, you'll look inside a
fat molecule and see how it is built.

10
00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:32.700
Then you'll calculate exactly how much alkali
it takes to turn a fat completely into soap.

11
00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:37.640
Your mission: explain how boiling fat
with an alkali turns it into soap.